HST Office: picture and table style galleries on the contextual ribbon tabs (Writer, Sheets, Slides).

Owner decision (14/11/2026, gap list G20 moved into 1.0.2): the "Định dạng ảnh" and "Thiết kế bảng" tabs get
a one-row gallery of 8 HST-designed styles, like the reference suite's Picture Styles and Table Styles.

- svx HstStyleGalleryData: the 8 picture styles (no style, thin border, blue border, white frame with shadow,
  soft shadow, dark frame, thin border with drop shadow, blue border with shadow) and the 8 table styles
  (HST blue, light grid, green, orange, teal, purple, charcoal, minimal) in HST colours.
- svx HstStyleDispatcher: protocol handler vnd.hst.styles:Picture / vnd.hst.styles:Table with Style=<id>,
  applied through UNO in one undo context; read-only documents and selections without a picture or table
  change nothing. Pictures map to native properties: Writer frame borders + ShadowFormat (docx a:ln and outer
  shadow), Sheets/Slides shape LineStyle/LineColor/LineWidth + Shadow* (xlsx/pptx a:ln, a:outerShdw).
  Tables: Writer TableStyles family + TableTemplateName (autoformat: direct cell formatting in docx);
  Slides "table" design with "cell" styles + TableTemplate (the table's header/banding options stay);
  Sheets the table's TableStyleName (header row / banded rows options stay).
- sc HstTableStyles: the HST styles as custom Sheets table styles in every document beside the OOXML ones
  (exported to xlsx as tableStyles with dxfs only when a table uses them; both row stripes repeat the row line
  because the export writes no inner lines of the whole table).
- svx HstSlidesTableStyle: Sheets/Slides shape properties set through UNO leave no undo action, so the picture
  styles record SdrUndoAttrObj first; the Slides table design is set like the Table Design pane does
  (TableStyleUndo, direct cell attributes the design also sets are cleared).
- svx HstStyleGalleryWindow/Control: .uno:HstPictureStyles and .uno:HstTableStyles (generic Controller.xcu
  entries) show one row of tiles drawn in code on the field colour (light and dark mode), 6/4/3 tiles for the
  ribbon ladder's "hst-gallery-state", ◂ ▸ paging and ▾ for the full options (Writer picture dialog / line
  dialog, Writer table styles dialog, Sheets sidebar, Slides table design). No live preview on hover:
  applying and undoing on hover would discard the redo stack and mark the document modified.
- Rounded corners and reflection are not offered: LibreOffice pictures have no native property for them.

All in svxcore (sc links it; the Slides table code needs svx's private table headers).

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0); new files MPL-2.0.
Test: tests/unit/test_picture_table_style_galleries.py reads the patch; tests/runtime/check-style-galleries.py
dispatches every style in Writer, Sheets and Slides, checks the properties, one undo action, and the
.docx/.xlsx/.pptx round trip.
